            "selectedCandidate": {
              "baseRefName": "auto/integration",
              "body": "## Summary\n\nImplements comprehensive property-based testing for core mill invariants using fast-check:\n\n- **Failure Policy**: Validates that any unrecognized failure strings classify as non-terminal and classification is deterministic\n- **Condition Reconciler**: Verifies markers don't outlive their conditions and reconciliation is idempotent\n- **Bounded Retry**: Ensures attempts respect the ceiling, new heads reset buckets, and exhausted states carry companions\n- **Merge Labels**: Confirms deriveMergeLabel is pure and reconciliation converges within one tick\n\nAll 4 property suites run in <5s each with reproducible seeded execution. Replaces the unseeded random test with deterministic property generators.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `shared/lib/fast-check-utils.ts` - Shared seed resolver and reproducibility harness\n- `shared/lib/property-generators.ts` - Event sequence and state generators\n- `shared/lib/failure-policy.property.test.ts` - Failure classification properties (4 props)\n- `shared/lib/bounded-retry.property.test.ts` - Bounded retry invariants (5 props)\n- `shared/lib/condition-reconciler.property.test.ts` - Marker lifetime properties (4 props)\n- `shared/lib/merge-labels.property.test.ts` - Label derivation and reconciliation properties (5 props)\n- `package.json` - Added fast-check@^3.23.0 as devDependency\n- `tests/run-unit-tests.sh` - Registered 4 new property suites\n- `tests/ci-test-weights.json` - Updated test weights manifest\n- Deleted `shared/lib/failure-policy.random.test.ts` (subsumed by property suite)\n\n## Test plan\n\n- All 4 property suites run via `npm test` and register in CI\n- Seeds are announced to stderr and embedded in failure headers for replay\n- `FAST_CHECK_SEED` environment variable overrides seed (default 0x30303017 in CI, random locally)\n- Reproduction: `FAST_CHECK_SEED=<reported seed> npm test -- <suite name>`\n\n## Self-review\n\n- Review verdict: **ready** (iteration 2)\n- Blockers: 0\n- Warnings: 0\n- Fixed cross-PR revert acknowledgement in commit message per PR #1614\n\n<!-- wavemill-fixture-meta\ntask: FIXTURE-1\n-->",
